{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>Then shall stand up in his place:</b> in his stead, a king who shall send out a tax oppressor, and he shall have the glory of the kingdom." "<b>And he shall be broken:</b> but not in honor, and a king shall arise after him, the opposite of the first one's character, for this one shall be despised."], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:21:04.847850550Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}